reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-6-// over a SYMBOLIC dict passes `dictV(KS, WS)` with a symbolic key sequence KS and reads
reference-semantics/semantics/dict.k-7-// `d.keys() = list(KS)`, then keeps each key opaque problem-locally.
